* A macro defined in a vsect and called in code: r68 puts its dc in the code.
* fixed: (not committed) 2026-10-11 r68togas: a macro's dc and ds where it is called
* expect text: 6f6e6500
* expect size: .data 0
 psect macro_code_call,0,0,0,0,0
 vsect
DEFS macro
_S\1 dc.b "\1",0
 endm
 ends
 DEFS one
 ends
